From: Tatoh <tatukis@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:53:40 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?[es]=20TU=5FTILDE:=20don't=20flag=20=C2=ABtu?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C2=BB=20when=20an=20ellipsis=20separates=20it=20from=20its=20n?=
 =?UTF-8?q?oun?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The catch-all subrule of TU_TILDE has an antipattern that lets «tu» through
when a singular noun follows (optionally after adverbs or an opening question
mark). An ellipsis between the determiner and its noun breaks that antipattern,
so «me ha sorprendido tu… conjuro» is reported as a missing accent on the
personal pronoun «tú», when «tu» is the possessive and the dots are a pause,
not a clause boundary.

Both spellings trigger it: «…» (U+2026) is a single token, «...» is tokenized
as three. The antipattern now skips up to three of those tokens.

Measured on a 810k-word Spanish novel corpus where ellipses are frequent in
dialogue: 22 TU_TILDE matches before, 2 after, and no new matches. All 20
suppressed ones were this false positive. The 2 that remain are a different
issue — the sentence is split at the ellipsis when «¿» or a capital follows,
so the noun is out of reach of any rule.
---
 .../src/main/resources/org/languagetool/rules/es/grammar.xml   | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/languagetool-language-modules/es/src/main/resources/org/languagetool/rules/es/grammar.xml b/languagetool-language-modules/es/src/main/resources/org/languagetool/rules/es/grammar.xml
index 912eeb620cf..ed09714728d 100644
--- a/languagetool-language-modules/es/src/main/resources/org/languagetool/rules/es/grammar.xml
+++ b/languagetool-language-modules/es/src/main/resources/org/languagetool/rules/es/grammar.xml
@@ -9577,6 +9577,7 @@ Foundation, Inc., 51 Franklin St, Fifth Floor, Boston, MA 02110-1301, USA
                 </antipattern>
                 <antipattern>
                     <token>tu</token>
+                    <token min="0" max="3" regexp="yes">…|\.</token>
                     <token min="0" max="4" postag_regexp="yes" postag="R.|LOC_ADV|_QM_OPEN"/>
                     <token postag="N..[SN].*|A...[SN].|_GN_.S|DN.*|UNKNOWN|_possible_NP|V.N.*|V.P..S." postag_regexp="yes"><exception postag="V.[IS].2S." postag_regexp="yes"/></token>
                 </antipattern>
@@ -9610,6 +9611,8 @@ Foundation, Inc., 51 Franklin St, Fifth Floor, Boston, MA 02110-1301, USA
                 <example>Es tu hermosa gente trabajadora.</example>
                 <example>¿Cómo vas a explicar la razón de tu no asistencia?</example>
                 <example>¡Espero que hayas practicado tu solo de flauta!</example>
+                <example>Me ha sorprendido tu… conjuro.</example>
+                <example>Vi tu... casa.</example>
             </rule>
             <rule>
                 <antipattern>
